# ArrowDown past the last button of a consent dialog in a frame over the whole window keeps the ring on that button: no ring was left anywhere (Formula 1).
pages/consent-frame-over-page.html
key:ArrowDown
key:ArrowDown*4
wait:300
expect:css=#manage
key:ArrowDown
wait:300
expect:css=#manage
key:ArrowUp
wait:300
expect:css=#essential
